Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's home, planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure that's\Nwhere I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let me back up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.10,0:01:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all began when the climate\Nwent completely out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rainforest dried out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and other places got totally flooded\Nwith oceans like chocolate sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get this, cities which were normally\Nblazing hot in the summer got super cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the time, I didn't know any of this\Nwas going on because I was at camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the other campers were, you\Nknow, goofing off and hanging out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, I was enjoying the summer sun while\Ngoing over my multiplication tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, until it started to snow in\Nthe middle of July, totally freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it gets weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what happened\Nto me and six other kids.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.93,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Yagami Taich{\b0}i
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.97,0:02:23.93,Sign,,500,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 5th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.96,0:02:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, my name's Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Sora.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.87,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Takenouchi Sora{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.87,Sign,,500,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 5th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's okay, for a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? And Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt's too cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.81,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Ishida Yamato{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.35,0:02:33.81,Sign,,500,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 5th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at that haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this little kid is Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have gone to computer\Ncamp. Huh? That's Mimi.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.75,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Izumi Koushiro{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.75,Sign,,500,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 4th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you can guess her\Nfavorite color on the first try.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.68,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Tachikawa Mimi{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.68,Sign,,500,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 4th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. is Matt's dopey little brother.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.62,Sign,,500,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {\Sign\b1}Takaishi Takeru{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.62,Sign,,500,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Kawada Elementary School\N 2nd Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and this is Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't ever scare him.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.56,Sign,,500,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Kido Jyou
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.56,Sign,,500,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5} {Sign}Odaiba Elementary School\N 6th Grade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd probably wet his pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there we all were at camp when suddenly\Nthis huge blizzard came out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.61,0:03:07.07,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Adrift? The Island of Adventure{\i1}!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, the canoe\Nraces were cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.80,0:03:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's have toboggan races instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to build the biggest snowman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, TK, be careful. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brr, it is freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I didn't bring a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I was worried I'd\Ncatch a summer cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I pack my\Nfluffy pink snow boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This storm's making a mess of my\Ninfrared internet connection. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wow hey what's your name izzy come on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out here you gotta see this whoa it's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beautiful magical even yeah yeah but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is it maybe an aurora you mean
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aurora borealis, the northern lights?\NThat's impossible! You see that in Alaska.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're way too far south.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell that to the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really think we ought to get back\Ninside before we all come down with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky is like short-circuiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're still here that was\Nscary what what was it
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meteors
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:04:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay so it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What... are these? My\Nguess is some sort of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miniature remote digital\Napparatus no instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo! Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.24,0:05:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the last time I eat camp food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't need to be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you had your rabies shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to\Nbe all right now, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means talking head? Hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.70,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}KOROMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.70,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.70,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.70,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type\N Data
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.70,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack\N Bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.86,0:06:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means brave little warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget it, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what did you mean\Nyou've been waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how did you know my name? Tai? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, is that you? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've got this little pink\Nthing following me everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is me, Motimon, at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody want lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends call me Motimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.72,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}MOTIMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.72,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.72,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.72,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.72,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone does, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:07:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe those miniature remote digital\Ngadgets have taken on an actual life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.16,0:07:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember anything like\Nthis in the camp for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.24,0:07:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vegetation is lush, but\Nthe soil appears rather common.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is common in DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.52,0:07:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are in the DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.32,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just where is the DigiWorld?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care so much about where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will know what it is. Guess I'll\Njust take a look around for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ocean? What's that doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our campsite was nowhere near the ocean\NAnd I sure don't remember those mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm Something tells me a\Ncompass isn't gonna help much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing I recognize. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.68,0:08:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some sort of giant red beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's flying right at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is one seriously bad Digimon,\Neven when he's in good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Gokimon.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.53,0:08:32.50,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}KUWAGAMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.53,0:08:32.50,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.53,0:08:32.50,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Insect \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.53,0:08:32.50,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NVirus
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.53,0:08:32.50,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NScissor Arms
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an insectoid Digimon,\Nvicious and ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with teeth like knives and scissor\Nhands that can chop through anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who needs a gardener?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have had better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little guy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should pick on bugs your own\Nsize. What's your name? Koromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's me. You're pretty\Nbrave for a little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, he's heading this way again Oh dear,\Noh dear, quickly everyone This way, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For having two long legs,\Nyou boys are awfully slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside this tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of tree is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hiding tree, silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.82,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to hide anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.72,0:10:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we were just planning the trap\Nwe were gonna set for that big bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am enchanted to meet you,\Nfriends of Sora. Welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.01,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}PYOCOMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.01,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.01,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.01,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.05,0:10:23.01,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.54,0:10:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Izzy, meet Yokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My own personal something or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks kinda like a radish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be another one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're popping up everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}TOKOMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.37,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, I am Tokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey TK, over here Coming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, there you are TK
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Matt, you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm here too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.04,0:11:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I meant that under\Nyour arm Oh, this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.64,0:11:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, you appear pleasant.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.59,0:11:07.55,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}TSUNOMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.59,0:11:07.55,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.59,0:11:07.55,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.59,0:11:07.55,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.59,0:11:07.55,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsunomon is my name, and I\Nam quite pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing, this thing,\Nit won't leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.44,0:11:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you calling a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A no-stuffed animal.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}PUKAMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser \NDigimon
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.04,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name is Pagumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see this\Ncreature hanging off me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those creatures standing right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're... Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not just digital monsters. We're\Nmuch more than that. We're kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And very loyal With beautiful hair Or
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe no hair at all We can be funny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And adorable! It's a pleasure to\Nmeet each of you. My name's Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and these are my friends from camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice place you got here, except the bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.94,0:12:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the self-proclaimed\Ncool one over there is mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No autographs, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd shake hands, if you had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy here's our computer expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have Internet access?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, this little\Nguy is, uh... TK! Call me TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.30,0:12:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm not as small as I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There now, is that everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to that\Ngirl with the funny pink hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps she's off picking\Nflowers or going on a nature hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, help me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so she's not picking flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that big bug again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, are you all right?\NI think so. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Sign,,0,180,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\Sign\b1}TANEMON{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Baby
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Lesser\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Type \NData
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{Sign}Special Attack \NBubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tannemont's here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.46,0:13:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay now. Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.94,0:13:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it. Here he comes. Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this nightmare never end?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom is going to want a\Ncomplete and total refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.76,0:14:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.86,0:14:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else can we do? She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can fight that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in Wynn, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anybody bring a helicopter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.90,0:14:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Tai. Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another way where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.72,0:15:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to make a good impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.32,0:15:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tanemon, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be programmed for courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.12,0:16:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tsunomon, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pukamon, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we'd seen the last of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he had other plans, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have\Nbrought my bug spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we fight. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way. Stand and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Coromon's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time that we showed\Nwhat we're made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't. They're right.\NNo way... It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no match for him, Yokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can do it, we can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tanemon, you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's useless! Yokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.24,0:17:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, did you evolve, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can evolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yokomon, did you evolve, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.72,0:18:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Venomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Motimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Tentomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsunomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.64,0:18:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to... Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bakemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tanemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.50,0:18:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to the little guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're... bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.94,0:18:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison Ivy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom Bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back, everyone! Pepper breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New blaster!
