Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, all together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.36,0:20:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made people where we're out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you we could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that super shocker?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty wizard, huh?
