Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we celebrated too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just when we make some\Npretty cool friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.48,0:20:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we all take a plunge, never\Nto see each other again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, but find out\Nfor yourself next time on Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters!
