Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it's cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
