Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was reaching the sky\Nand reached the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the home of the Shellmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a huge power of Shellmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was lost from the\None who lost his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark will be made to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:22:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, the day of the adventure.
